OL,3,GNEWSA'Deal with dissidents' may need to
OL,4,Abe made to increase recruitment in PSNI
OL,5,A- Denis Bradley
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first vice-chair of the Policing
OL,8,FBoard has said that it may be necessary
OL,9,Fto make a deal with dissident
OL,10,Frepublicans in order to increase
OL,11,Frecruitment from young people from
OL,12,Fnationalist backgrounds to the PSNI.
OL,14,FDenis Bradley said "dissidency still
OL,15,Fretains the power to frighten people
OL,16,Faway," from joining the force.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
