OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Deal with dissidents' may need to
OL,4,Abe made to increase recruitment in PSNI
OL,5,A- Denis Bradley
OL,6,
OL,7,FBradley's comments come on the 25th
OL,8,Fanniversary of the Police Service of
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI), which the
OL,10,FChief Constable Jon Boutcher said is a
OL,11,Fmoment to look back on with "great
OL,12,Fpride".
OL,14,FWhile of the key objectives of the PSNI
OL,15,Fwas to build greater community support
OL,16,Ffor the police and increase Catholic
OL,17,Fofficers Catholics remain
OL,18,Funder-represented in today's PSNI.
